.TH HAMSTIK 1 "HAMSTIK COMMANDS"
.SH NAME
hamstik commands \- Print the machine\-readable command manifest derived from the real command tree (CLI\-2)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hamstik commands [OPTIONS]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the machine\-readable command manifest derived from the real command tree (CLI\-2)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --format
Output format for the manifest
Choices: json
Default: json
